            "review_text": "Lou J\n1 contribution\n0\nWorst place ever!!\nFeb 2026 • Family\nThis was one of the most disappointing experiences I’ve had.\n\nThe space is extremely small, damp, and poorly maintained. It feels dusty and unclean, and the staircase leading upstairs is narrow and potentially unsafe. The menu is very limited, and there is no card payment option available.\n\nMore concerning than the physical condition, however, is the owner’s behavior. The attitude was consistently rude, condescending, and openly discriminatory. There appeared to be unequal treatment toward customers based on background, with foreign customers seemingly prioritized while locals and people of color were treated dismissively. I personally witnessed shouting at customers and even asking guests to leave.\n\nAdditionally, the owner frequently sat with feet on the table, which was both unhygienic and inappropriate for a food establishment.\n\nThis place does not reflect the hospitality and warmth that Vietnam is known for. I sincerely hope local authorities look into the conditions and conduct here, as discriminatory behavior and poor hygiene standards should not be tolerated.\nRead more\nWritten February 15, 2026",
