            "review_text": "Đỗ Phương T\n1 contribution\n0\nBAD\nDec 2025 • Friends\nthe service was a bummer! Grumpy faces with bad attitudes! When I asked for additional sugar, a staff reacted as if she was unpleasant about my requirement! Moreover, they later on told us that the sitting time was limited and that if we left now then the drinks would be free. We asked them if we could sit just a bit longer, they agreed but said no furthermore about whether we needed to pay for the drinks or not, so we mistook it for not having to pay! When we left, they asked us to pay, we then asked that we thought we did not have to! They berated us, told us we were idiots and calling us names, and lectured about how insolent we were for thinking we took a couple of photos and sit for 20’ more then we would not have to pay, when all we did was asking to assure and to make sure about the misunderstanding! They even threatened to beat us? Tbh, I have never seen anywhere with this horrible service! The atmosphere was unwelcoming and the way they handle conflict and misunderstanding with guests was just a big NO for me. I thought we were the only one who encountered this but apparently not!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 6, 2025",
